=== Hosts and judges ===
[[Alfonso Ribeiro]] and [[Julianne Hough]] returned as hosts for the season.<ref name="UWGuide">{{Cite web |last=Nardino |first=Meredith |date=May 22, 2025 |title=''Dancing With the Stars'' Season 34: Cast, Premiere Date and More |url=https://www.usmagazine.com/entertainment/news/dancing-with-the-stars-season-34-cast-premiere-date-and-more/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250522191410/https://www.usmagazine.com/entertainment/news/dancing-with-the-stars-season-34-cast-premiere-date-and-more/ |archive-date=May 22, 2025 |access-date=May 22, 2025 |website=[[Us Weekly]] |language=en-US}}</ref> [[Derek Hough]], [[Carrie Ann Inaba]] and [[Bruno Tonioli]] returned as judges.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Roots |first=Kimberly |date=August 18, 2025 |title=''Dancing With the Stars'' Judges, Hosts Set for ''TVLine'' Spotlight Conversation in New York |url=https://www.tvline.com/news/dancing-with-the-stars-event-tickets-new-york-city-2025-1235488747/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250818212000/https://tvline.com/news/dancing-with-the-stars-event-tickets-new-york-city-2025-1235488747/ |archive-date=August 18, 2025 |access-date=August 21, 2025 |website=[[TVLine]] |language=en-US}}</ref> Inaba missed the season premiere due to an undisclosed illness; there was no replacement judge set in her place.<ref name="InabaPremiere">{{Cite web |last=Campione |first=Katie |date=September 16, 2025 |title=Carrie Ann Inaba To Miss ''Dancing With The Stars'' Season 34 Premiere Due To Illness; No Replacement Judge Set |url=https://deadline.com/2025/09/carrie-ann-inaba-sick-dwts-season-34-premiere-1236545698/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250916195248/https://deadline.com/2025/09/carrie-ann-inaba-sick-dwts-season-34-premiere-1236545698/ |archive-date=September 16, 2025 |access-date=September 16, 2025 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |language=en-US}}</ref> An official ''Dancing with the Stars'' [[podcast]], hosted by season thirty-three winner [[Joey Graziadei]], was launched on September 18, 2025.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Rice |first=Lynette |date=September 12, 2025 |title=''Dancing With The Stars'' Will Launch Podcast Featuring Joey Graziadei |url=https://deadline.com/2025/09/dancing-with-the-stars-podcast-featuring-joey-graziadei-1236530024/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250912173441/https://deadline.com/2025/09/dancing-with-the-stars-podcast-featuring-joey-graziadei-1236530024/ |archive-date=September 12, 2025 |access-date=September 18, 2025 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |language=en-US}}</ref> He revealed all of the season's themes during the inaugural episode,<ref name="S34Themes">{{Cite podcast |url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=64gggvXXF5k |title=Episode 1: Season Premiere Breakdown |website=Dancing with the Stars Official Podcast |publisher=[[BBC Studios]] |host=[[Joey Graziadei|Graziadei, Joey]] |date=September 18, 2025 |access-date=September 18, 2025 |time=17:40}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Nardino |first=Meredith |date=September 18, 2025 |title=''Dancing With the Stars'' Season 34 Themes Revealed |url=https://www.usmagazine.com/entertainment/news/dancing-with-the-stars-season-34-themes-revealed/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250924080929/https://www.usmagazine.com/entertainment/news/dancing-with-the-stars-season-34-themes-revealed/ |archive-date=September 24, 2025 |access-date=September 18, 2025 |website=[[Us Weekly]] |language=en-US}}</ref> and later shared the freestyle songs for the season finale.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Campione |first=Katie |date=November 20, 2025 |title=''Dancing With The Stars'' Season 34 Finale Freestyle Songs Revealed |url=https://deadline.com/feature/dancing-with-the-stars-season-34-finale-freestyle-songs-1236624891/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251121082749/https://deadline.com/feature/dancing-with-the-stars-season-34-finale-freestyle-songs-1236624891/ |archive-date=November 21, 2025 |access-date=November 20, 2025 |website=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |language=en-US}}</ref>

