=== Dance troupe ===
[[Hailey Bills]], Onye Stevenson, Carter Williams, and Jaxon Willard joined the show as first-time troupe members.<ref name="Troupe">{{Cite web |last=Hudgins |first=Ryan |date=September 10, 2025 |title=Meet the ''Dancing With the Stars'' Season 34 Troupe — Including Jenna Johnson's Niece (Exclusive) |url=https://www.usmagazine.com/entertainment/news/dancing-with-the-stars-season-34-troupe-meet-the-new-dancers/ |access-date=September 10, 2025 |website=[[Us Weekly]] |language=en-US|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20250910202456/https://www.usmagazine.com/entertainment/news/dancing-with-the-stars-season-34-troupe-meet-the-new-dancers/|archive-date=September 10, 2025|url-status=live}}</ref> Bills is the niece of Jenna Johnson and a former pro on ''[[Dancing with the Stars: Juniors]]''.<ref name="Troupe" /> Williams was a top six finalist on the [[So You Think You Can Dance (American TV series) season 17|seventeenth season]] of ''[[So You Think You Can Dance (American TV series)|So You Think You Can Dance]]''.<ref name="Troupe" /> Willard was a contestant on the [[World of Dance season 2|second season]] of ''[[World of Dance (TV series)|World of Dance]]''.<ref name="Troupe" />

