=== Week 10: Prince Night (Semi-Finals) ===
Each couple performed two dances to songs by [[Prince (musician)|Prince]]: one unlearned style and a repeat style that gave them the chance to showcase their improvement.<ref name="Week10PR">{{Cite press release |title=Purple Rain Meets the Ballroom in a Semi-Finals Showdown on ''Dancing with the Stars,'' Nov. 18 |date=November 13, 2025 |publisher=[[American Broadcasting Company|ABC]] |url=https://www.detpress.com/abc/pressrelease/purple-rain-meets-the-ballroom-in-a-semi-finals-showdown-on-dancing-with-the-stars-nov-18/ |via=[[Disney General Entertainment Content Press]] |access-date=November 13, 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20251209021402/https://www.detpress.com/abc/pressrelease/purple-rain-meets-the-ballroom-in-a-semi-finals-showdown-on-dancing-with-the-stars-nov-18/ |archive-date=December 9, 2025}}</ref> The opening number, choreographed by Luam Keflezgy, was set to "[[Let's Go Crazy]]". The troupe also performed a number to "[[Musicology (song)|Musicology]]".<ref name="Week10PR" />

